  "notes": "ROSTER DISCREPANCY (trusted the image): official roster lists Carthaginian MI 3 / MC 2, but the map shows only 2 MI on board (1,5 and 1,6) and 3 MC in total (0,10, 0,11 plus 1 MC in Mago's off-board ambush force). The special rules text independently confirms the ambush force is '1 medium cavalry and the 2 medium warriors', so the roster's MI/MC split appears to be an error (total of 18 Carthaginian units agrees). Reserves: Mago's ambush force (MC, WA, WA + a Carthaginian leader) is drawn off-board along the bottom-right image edge; the leader portrait's caption is cut off by the image edge, the name 'Mago' comes from the special rules text. River: 7 fordable river hexes - runs along row 7 from the left board edge (7,0-7,5), bends at 7,5 and exits the bottom edge through 8,6. No other terrain. Leaders: Hanno with LC 0,1; Hannibal with HI 1,8; Sempronius with MI 6,6. Move First icon is in the Roman block. Special rules text: one mid-sentence HTML <br> ('This set on counts / as the first hex') was joined with a space."
